-icons/Sapidity.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Spirit born of the meals people cook every day. Everything picked up by the chopsticks—joy or sorrow, mirth or anger—is a slice of life.","abilities":["Unblockable; Moves towards <Stoves> and can be absorbed by them, increasing their SP","Must be damaged 5 times to defeat; Spawns 1 <Vapidity> when defeated","Does not count towards the defeated enemies counter; Automatically moves towards <Stoves>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":5,"atk":100,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1.7}},"profanity":{"slug":"profanity","name":"Profanity","icon":"/enemies-icons/Profanity.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Abomination born of the influence of a Sui Proxy. Originally a clay pot that broke someone's skull, itself undamaged. The dinner table has always been a place for squabbles. Tables are flipped and pots are broken, but in the end, everyone might still have to sit back down and eat together.","abilities":["Can use long-ranged weapons to attack <Sapidity>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":6000,"atk":500,"def":200,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"humility":{"slug":"humility","name":"'Humility'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Humility'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A drink reveals one's true nature and inspires deep conversations. Abomination born of the influence of a Sui Proxy. Often appears in drunken squabbles, but usually disappears once one is sober.","abilities":["Pulls 1 <Sapidity> within range towards itself, causing it to lose HP proportio